{"number":92,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ","nameEnglish":"Al-Lail","englishMeaning":"The Night","revelationType":"Meccan","totalVerses":21,"audioUrl":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/092.mp3","ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"globalNumber":6059,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰ","translation":"By the night when it covers","transliteration":"Wallaili izaa yaghshaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6059.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":2,"globalNumber":6060,"arabic":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ","translation":"And [by] the day when it appears","transliteration":"Wannahaari izaa tajalla","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6060.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":3,"globalNumber":6061,"arabic":"وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلْأُنثَىٰٓ","translation":"And [by] He who created the male and female,","transliteration":"Wa maa khalaqaz zakara wal unthaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6061.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":4,"globalNumber":6062,"arabic":"إِنَّ سَعْيَكُمْ لَشَتَّىٰ","translation":"Indeed, your efforts are diverse.","transliteration":"Inna sa'yakum lashattaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6062.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":5,"globalNumber":6063,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَنْ أَعْطَىٰ وَٱتَّقَىٰ","translation":"As for he who gives and fears Allah","transliteration":"Fa ammaa man a'taa wattaqaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6063.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":6,"globalNumber":6064,"arabic":"وَصَدَّقَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","translation":"And believes in the best [reward],","transliteration":"Wa saddaqa bil husnaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6064.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":7,"globalNumber":6065,"arabic":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","translation":"We will ease him toward ease.","transliteration":"Fasanu yassiruhoo lilyusraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6065.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":6066,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنۢ بَخِلَ وَٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","translation":"But as for he who withholds and considers himself free of need","transliteration":"Wa ammaa mam bakhila wastaghnaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6066.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":6067,"arabic":"وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","translation":"And denies the best [reward],","transliteration":"Wa kazzaba bil husnaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6067.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":6068,"arabic":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْعُسْرَىٰ","translation":"We will ease him toward difficulty.","transliteration":"Fasanu yassiruhoo lil'usraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6068.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":6069,"arabic":"وَمَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥٓ إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ","translation":"And what will his wealth avail him when he falls?","transliteration":"Wa maa yughnee 'anhu maaluhooo izaa taraddaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6069.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":6070,"arabic":"إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا لَلْهُدَىٰ","translation":"Indeed, [incumbent] upon Us is guidance.","transliteration":"Inna 'alainaa lal hudaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6070.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":6071,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ لَنَا لَلْءَاخِرَةَ وَٱلْأُولَىٰ","translation":"And indeed, to Us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life].","transliteration":"Wa inna lanaa lal Aakhirata wal oolaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6071.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":6072,"arabic":"فَأَنذَرْتُكُمْ نَارًۭا تَلَظَّىٰ","translation":"So I have warned you of a Fire which is blazing.","transliteration":"Fa anzartukum naaran talazzaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6072.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":